    {
      "source": "<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-hateoas/docs/current/api/org/springframework/hateoas/server/EntityLinks.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.hateoas.server\"><code>EntityLinks</code></a> implementation that is able to create <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-hateoas/docs/current/api/org/springframework/hateoas/Link.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.hateoas\"><code>Link</code></a> for domain classes managed by Spring Data\nREST.",
