      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Creates the link to the search resource with the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-hateoas/docs/current/api/org/springframework/hateoas/LinkRelation.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.hateoas\"><code>LinkRelation</code></a> for a given type. Uses the given\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Pageable.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Pageable</code></a> to pre-expand potentially available template variables.",
